{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":31123,\"title\":\"Red Zone Cuba\",\"tagline\":\"Make the Mistake!\",\"overview\":\"Griffin escapes from jail and teams up with two local thugs to invade Cuba. However, they're soon captured by a Castro look-alike and receive sub-human treatment. But Griffin hatches a plan- will it be enough to bring peace to Cuba?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oqh6rEJbUZOiSd9h1SfKe1Oh6fZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/naBftqr9LOZDZe2WZruohmMCM2g.jpg\",\"rating\":2.7,\"voteCount\":33,\"year\":1966,\"runtime\":89,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Coleman Francis\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":45091,\"name\":\"Coleman Francis\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fOxcrVlmQYc7dr1JQNxM6V8D8f4.jpg\"},{\"id\":8516,\"name\":\"John Carradine\",\"character\":\"Mr. Wilson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hv2AAXNlTHVmGgXn8q7025S0g2b.jpg\"},{\"id\":45091,\"name\":\"Coleman Francis\",\"character\":\"Griffin / Narrator\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fOxcrVlmQYc7dr1JQNxM6V8D8f4.jpg\"},{\"id\":89192,\"name\":\"Anthony Cardoza\",\"character\":\"Landis / Fidel Castro\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1494662,\"name\":\"Harold Saunders\",\"character\":\"Cook\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4041659,\"name\":\"Tom Hanson\",\"character\":\"Bailey Chastain (as Tom Hansen)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":70160,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36557,\"title\":\"Casino Royale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lMrxYKKhd4lqRzwUHAy5gcx9PSO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/klJMCIblHLFwCuGjKz7tyOpekIC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Le Chiffre, a banker to the world's terrorists, is scheduled to participate in a high-stakes poker game in Montenegro, where he intends to use his winnings to establish his financial grip on the terrorist market. M sends Bond—on his maiden mission as a 00 Agent—to attend this game and prevent Le Chiffre from winning. With the help of Vesper Lynd and Felix Leiter, Bond enters the most important poker game in his already dangerous career.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396535,\"title\":\"Train to Busan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vNVFt6dtcqnI7hqa6LFBUibuFiw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/brnfCYyz8EMbBrHgmh8sCwBi5i1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a zombie virus pushes Korea into a state of emergency, those trapped on an express train to Busan must fight for their own survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":575265,\"title\":\"Mission: Impossible - The Final Reckoning\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKPsC9EFUafRP9SrUznI61getVP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/538U9snNc2fpnOmYXAPUh3zn31H.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ethan Hunt and team continue their search for the terrifying AI known as the Entity — which has infiltrated intelligence networks all over the globe — with the world's governments and a mysterious ghost from Hunt's past on their trail. Joined by new allies and armed with the means to shut the Entity down for good, Hunt is in a race against time to prevent the world as we know it from changing forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":370172,\"title\":\"No Time to Die\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iUgygt3fscRoKWCV1d0C7FbM9TP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9td0NQha0t44K2qgcMipLOGjVi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bond has left active service and is enjoying a tranquil life in Jamaica. His peace is short-lived when his old friend Felix Leiter from the CIA turns up asking for help. The mission to rescue a kidnapped scientist turns out to be far more treacherous than expected, leading Bond onto the trail of a mysterious villain armed with dangerous new technology.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":37724,\"title\":\"Skyfall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d0IVecFQvsGdSbnMAHqiYsNYaJT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wkA622CCN2X0uwpgqYEOnUYEDf5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bond's latest assignment goes gravely wrong, agents around the world are exposed and MI6 headquarters is attacked. While M faces challenges to her authority and position from Gareth Mallory, the new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee, it's up to Bond, aided only by field agent Eve, to locate the mastermind behind the attack.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":135397,\"title\":\"Jurassic World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkXjL03yWPmiuFqxWEp4zSYVZBY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF6FjTZzRTENfB4R17HDN20jLT2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":539972,\"title\":\"Kraven the Hunter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GvBhRxY6MELDfxFrete6BNhBB5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bGGjyPqtNc8hhGkPo8W8D8t90bW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kraven Kravinoff's complex relationship with his ruthless gangster father, Nikolai, starts him down a path of vengeance with brutal consequences, motivating him to become not only the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":206647,\"title\":\"Spectre\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zj8ongFhtWNsVlfjOGo8pSr7PQg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cCKU3EuiSKt6xsOI6gg5kiFgZYm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A cryptic message from Bond’s past sends him on a trail to uncover a sinister organization. While M battles political forces to keep the secret service alive, Bond peels back the layers of deceit to reveal the terrible truth behind SPECTRE.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10764,\"title\":\"Quantum of Solace\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e3DXXLJHGqMx9yYpXsql1XNljmM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uGs5Z7dMguf7kxWubGFcp9EhKcy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Betrayed by Vesper, the woman he loved, 007 fights the urge to make his latest mission personal. Pursuing his determination to uncover the truth, Bond and M interrogate Mr. White, who reveals that the organization that blackmailed Vesper is far more complex and dangerous than anyone had imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7451,\"title\":\"xXx\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwK9soQmmJ7kRdjLZVXblw3g7AQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government \\\"recruits\\\" him to go on a mission, he's not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":180,\"title\":\"Minority Report\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qtgFcnwh9dAFLocsDk2ySDVS8UF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/PrMb3oeEluauy0q9ZO5xL33A6C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"John Anderton is a top 'Precrime' cop in the late-21st century, when technology can predict crimes before they're committed. But Anderton becomes the quarry when another investigator targets him for a murder charge.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"aJvrpa2F2Sg\",\"name\":\"Mystery Science Theater 3000: Red Zone Cuba - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}